  storyId: story_main_07
  storyName: Business as Usual
  storyDescription: 'Trady opens her shop. Reward: free Coins and Shop items.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 7
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2b20b1b20889d1c885487efbc334c35, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: After the battle, Trady and Cashino introduce their respective services.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, well. Look who's still standing! Welcome to my shop, Your Majesty!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You run a shop?
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Naturally! Someone has to make a profit around here.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do you always charge people for everything?
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Of course not! Sometimes I charge them for things they don't even know
        they need.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY! THAT'S MY LINE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh, please. You wouldn't know a good business opportunity if it hit you
        in the face.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I KNOW GAMBLING!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Exactly my point.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Here. Some Coins and a few samples, on the house. Go and try buying something!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
